*- [EPIC] [TI-0053] Evidence-preserving transcript review
  [DESC] Let users inspect and correct transcripts without overwriting the original evidence record.

    $- [FT] [TI-0054] View transcript timestamps and navigate to matching audio
      [DESC] Display immutable source segments and start microphone playback at the selected timestamp.
    $- [FT] [TI-0055] Edit transcript text while preserving original segments
      [DESC] Append user correction revisions, retain and reveal immutable source text, and update search/export display without overwriting evidence.
    *- [FT] [TI-0056] Regenerate only outputs affected by transcript corrections
    *- [ENH] [TI-0057] Mark low-confidence transcript segments visibly
      [DESC] Allow uncertain segments to be replayed, corrected, or reprocessed.
    *- [FT] [TI-0058] Choose native-script, romanized, or combined display
      [DESC] Display options must never overwrite the original transcript.
    $- [ENH] [TI-0103] Group continuous speech into readable transcript passages
      [DESC] Merge adjacent same-channel segments within pause, duration, and size limits while retaining accurate passage timestamps.
    $- [FT] [TI-0104] Delete a transcript without deleting its recording
      [DESC] Remove source passages, corrections, and search entries only after explicit confirmation so the recording can be transcribed again.

